    "describe_ch": "本課程分四個階段說明，一是專案的界定，二是專案設計，三是專案執行，是專案發展。",
    "describe_eh": "The arrangement of this course is based around the four stages of project life-cycle. The following outlines the contents of each. Phase one: Define the project. Phase two: Design the project process. Phase three: deliver the project. (do it) Phase four: Develop the project. (do it better next time)",
